\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mu_{j}=\frac{1}{N}\sum^{N}_{i=1}x_{i,j}\qquad\sigma^{2}_{j}=\frac{1}{N}\sum^{N}_{i=1}\left(x_{i,j}-\mu_{j}\right)^{2}
\]

\end_inset

ומנרמלים את 
\begin_inset Formula $x$
\end_inset

:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{x}_{i,j}=\frac{x_{i,j}-\mu_{j}}{\sqrt{\sigma^{2}_{j}+\varepsilon}}
\]

